OL,5,G1800 Murder She Wrote
OL,6,     FJessica hires a detective to
OL,7,     Finvestigate a 25-year-old unsolved
OL,8,     Fmurder case. When the detective is
OL,9,     Fkilled, Jessica steps in to figure
OL,10,     Fout why.
